### Search and rankings: popular-shows
GET {{base}}/api/v4/popular/shows?limit=5

### Search and rankings: momentum-shows
GET {{base}}/api/v4/shows/momentum?artist_ids=artist_3qmp7zjbg1rpebhtyfy43096vj&limit=5

### Shared venue: metadata and shows across approved artists
GET {{base}}/api/v4/venues/venue_fp4h900f

### Shared venue: artist collection beside global metadata
GET {{base}}/api/v4/artists/artist_3qmp7zjbg1rpebhtyfy43096vj/venues/venue_fp4h900f

### Direct relationship agrees with the artist and venue lookup
GET {{base}}/api/v4/artist-venues/artist_venue_344wrm28

### Requested imported venue: direct lookup with shows
GET {{base}}/api/v4/imported-venues/imported_venue_78331pxdqjdg434rrgm1d2pnrj

