### Phish: compact tour inventory and catalog show counts
GET {{base}}/api/v4/artists/artist_6aaf982021nrst0m68ew1djerc/tours

### Phish Fall Tour 1997: direct tour metadata and complete shows
GET {{base}}/api/v4/tours/tour_4emejbsvpbph76zy5kh1n954vt

### Phish: ordered era metadata, no public era identity
GET {{base}}/api/v4/artists/artist_6aaf982021nrst0m68ew1djerc/eras

### Recording reviews: complete upstream text and ratings
GET {{base}}/api/v4/sources/source_2cr3tmxwvyxp5g9jxzk1jf944x/reviews

### Completed live activity window
GET {{base}}/api/v4/live/summary?minutes=15&sort=surprise

### Resolve typed and legacy references (read-only POST; patches, not replacement)
POST {{base}}/api/v4/catalog/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "references": [
    { "kind": "artist", "scheme": "legacy_slug", "id": "grateful-dead" },
    { "kind": "track", "scheme": "legacy_uuid", "id": "790f8388-13ca-ea8f-5bf0-61e4cc13ac0d" },
    { "kind": "venue", "scheme": "v4", "id": "venue_fp4h900f" }
  ]
}
